# Act of Treason: "Gain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of
# turn." Bot2's Llanowar Elves is tapped (Bot2 tapped it for mana on their turn). Bot1 takes it (CR 613.1b, layer 2): it is
# untapped, and though it came under Bot1's control this turn it can attack, as it has haste (CR 302.6, 702.10): it attacks
# Bot2 for 1. When the turn ends, the effects end (CR 514.2) and the Elves is Bot2's again, without haste (CR 611.2a, 613.1b).

